      "id": 0,
      "message": "\u003cb\u003eTOCTOU race in PackageKit\u0026#39;s transaction handler. Any local unprivileged user can install arbitrary packages as root with no authentication.\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eBlog: \u003c/b\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://github.security.telekom.com/2026/04/pack2theroot-linux-local-privilege-escalation.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e\u003cb\u003ehttps://github.security.telekom.com/2026/04/pack2theroot-linux-local-privilege-escalation.html\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://github.com/Vozec/CVE-2026-41651\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e\u003cb\u003ehttps://github.com/Vozec/CVE-2026-41651\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://t.me/IRCyberGuardians\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e@IRCyberGuardians\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/a\u003e",
      "date": "2026-05-01T14:30:53Z",
